@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@hotelId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@checkIn = 2030-08-01
@checkOut = 2030-08-03

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### Reset all data
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/reset

### Seed Grand Plaza Hotel and six rooms
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/seed

### Find the seeded hotel
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels?name=Grand

### Find available rooms
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hotels/{{hotelId}}/rooms/available?checkIn={{checkIn}}&checkOut={{checkOut}}&guests=2&roomType=DOUBLE

### Create a booking
# @name createBooking
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hotelId": "{{hotelId}}",
  "guestName": "Ada Lovelace",
  "guestCount": 2,
  "checkInDate": "{{checkIn}}",
  "checkOutDate": "{{checkOut}}",
  "roomType": "DOUBLE"
}

### Look up the booking created above
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/bookings/{{createBooking.response.body.$.bookingReference}}
